{"id":"MOEX-112100-1301-Q062","title":"同一PO₂下的貧血與COHb：先確認飽和度分母","version":"v4","batch":"112-2-med1-q51-100","sourceSha256":"f85260e5cbcd7d3ee709b47fde5baa7d0b9b1a5b5ba65d5fba7b782f3b93e24e","shortHtml":"<p>官方答案為<strong>C</strong>，但必須釐清本題SaO₂的分母。三管都與<strong>PO₂＝40 mmHg</strong>的相同氣體達到平衡，故血中溶解氧的分壓相同；血紅素少一半不會讓平衡後PO₂自動少一半，也不會使甲的PO₂最高。</p>","html":"<h2>同一PO₂下的貧血與COHb：先確認飽和度分母</h2><div><div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:24px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.0909090909090908\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/112a7db224457353ca701ccdb6896be3f948ea12cd02c872b11bfdf8721a648e.png\" alt=\"原卷PO₂符號\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"22\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/112a7db224457353ca701ccdb6896be3f948ea12cd02c872b11bfdf8721a648e.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>原卷PO₂符號（原像素保留）</figcaption></figure><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:29px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.7058823529411764\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/cfbd93b8e7524601513eb3f8ea50b9a21a02d147785e6569e017634afab9b7c9.png\" alt=\"原卷SaO₂符號\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"17\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/cfbd93b8e7524601513eb3f8ea50b9a21a02d147785e6569e017634afab9b7c9.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>原卷SaO₂符號（原像素保留）</figcaption></figure></div></div><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：C</p><h3>先分清：分壓、飽和度與含氧量是三種量</h3>\n<p>官方答案為<strong>C</strong>，但必須釐清本題SaO₂的分母。三管都與<strong>PO₂＝40 mmHg</strong>的相同氣體達到平衡，故血中溶解氧的分壓相同；血紅素少一半不會讓平衡後PO₂自動少一半，也不會使甲的PO₂最高。</p>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>樣本</th><th>與氧結合的能力</th><th>固定PO₂下的判讀</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>甲：正常血紅素</td><td>正常可用結合位點</td><td>正常氧解離曲線的基準</td></tr><tr><td>乙：血紅素濃度減半</td><td>總容量約減半</td><td>其餘條件相同，未改變每個正常血紅素的氧親和力；飽和度不因此減半</td></tr><tr><td>丙：半數為COHb</td><td>一氧化碳血紅素（COHb）占去部分位點</td><td>一氧化碳（CO）並提高剩餘可用位點的氧親和力，使功能性氧飽和度較高</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3>為什麼CO中毒，飽和度高也可能缺氧？</h3>\n<p>本題採氧解離曲線常用的<strong>功能性氧飽和度</strong>：<strong>氧合血紅素÷（氧合血紅素＋去氧血紅素）</strong>，分母排除COHb。CO使血紅素偏向高親和力構形，剩餘位點在同一PO₂較容易抓住氧，故支持C；代價是<strong>可攜氧位點減少，而且氧更難釋放給組織</strong>。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1280px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.0738255033557047\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/128db069ad31eaf3fa3d4142851e9bc21a51fca9fb088fc1cf76804bb3ba75c6.png\" alt=\"相同氧分壓下，左移氧解離曲線具有較高氧飽和度的概念圖\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1192\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/128db069ad31eaf3fa3d4142851e9bc21a51fca9fb088fc1cf76804bb3ba75c6.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>左移曲線在同一PO₂較高，可用來理解「親和力增加」。本圖畫的是pH、溫度與2,3-DPG（二磷酸甘油酸）的通用位移，並非本題50% COHb三試管的實測曲線，不能由它讀出丙的精確數值。Ratznium等，作者釋出公有領域。</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>分母一改，答案的語意也會改</h3>\n<p><strong>分率氧合血紅素</strong>則以全部血紅素型態作分母，包含COHb及變性血紅素。丙已有50% COHb，其分率氧合血紅素不可能超過50%；若把題目的SaO₂解讀為這個量，就不能說丙必定最高。現代共氧血紅素分析儀可報告不同分母的數值，讀值必須確認定義。</p>\n<p>總含氧量還取決於血紅素總量及真正帶氧的比例，不能只看功能性飽和度。以總血紅素濃度估算時，結合氧項應乘<strong>分率氧合血紅素</strong>，不能把含COHb的總血紅素直接乘功能性SaO₂。A錯在分壓；B混淆濃度與飽和度；D混淆分壓與總含氧量。</p><details><summary>原題、答鍵與圖文查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部正式原題（卷碼1301）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?code=112100&amp;t=A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2023-09-05更正清冊：本科無更正紀錄</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5363978/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rose等2017：CO降低攜氧容量並使剩餘位點高親和力</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10171353/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hess2023：功能性與分率氧飽和度的分母</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Oxyhaemoglobin_dissociation_curve.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">通用氧解離曲線：作者釋出公有領域</a></li></ul></details>","imageCount":3,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：C"}